{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000011522","bookName":"La Reina del Campo de Batalla (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000011522/42000011522.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2955025,"followCount":42275,"introduction":"Xenia protegió sola a los habitantes en nombre de su padre y sus hermanos, muertos en combate. Para tranquilizar a su madre, le juró que ocultaría su servicio militar y que no volvería a luchar como generala. Se casó con Juan, y a partir de entonces se convirtió en la dama de la casa. La noche de su boda, Juan marchó a la guerra. Pero el primer acto de Juan a su regreso triunfal fuera obligarla a aceptar el matrimonio con otra mujer con su servicio militar. ","chapterCount":91,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-Reina-del-Campo-de-Batalla-Doblado","bookNameLower":"la-reina-del-campo-de-batalla-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-05-13 12:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-05-13 12:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"19494","performerName":"Qiuyuan Ma","performerFormatName":"Qiuyuan-Ma","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x9/19494/19494.jpg?time=1789711203379","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"22707","performerName":"Zirui Liu","performerFormatName":"Zirui-Liu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x0/22707/22707.jpg?time=1782970099402","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[19494,22707]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700759220","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/02/2x2/22x5/225x1/22511000024/700759220_1/700759220.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=Y1NNCTX6ssoGJIf8A-krTJOxJYgRTLNFOFxX9EJiRng0pi4JfuUDAbqmK3B541wra9bjPqsdYr7ZlCgNWEA6IuP4cvz92bCAXaf-XwXAXAGUkdtH43S8ZhgBDUbRKhTea~SczFMC2z